  "title": "Kitchen Fresh Vietnamese Split Peas Noodles",
  "description": "A quick and easy Vietnamese dish featuring split peas and score-fat noodles, with a citrusy flavor and low-fat friendly ingredients, this meal is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
